# Review fix (B-101): the DARK ignition checklist's "Stellar Ignition Charge" row reads the plinth bus without a
# recipe-processing window. T1 Eye from build-sites.shots (300 98 4): an Arcturus chart it cannot reach keeps it DARK
# with the full checklist, two charges go into the bus, then a Sol chart lights it (one charge used) and the chart is
# taken out again, so eye-t1.shots starts from the same DARK Eye (one charge stays in the bus).
tp 300.5 99 0.5
wait 80
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 target arcturus
wait 40
gui 300 98 4
wait 30
shot eye-dark-nocharge_s3
close
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 charge 2
wait 40
gui 300 98 4
wait 30
shot eye-dark-charges_s3
close
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 gt
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 target sol
wait 300
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 status
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 target none
wait 40
cmd /btseye star 300 98 4 gt
